@startuml
title MCU ↔ RPi ActionsLink Power Sequence

participant SysTask as "System Task"
participant AudioTask as "Audio Task"
participant RpiTask as "RPi Task (MCU)"
participant RpiDaemon as "RPi Daemon"
participant Moode

== MCU Hardware Boot ==

note over SysTask, RpiTask: **MCU PCB powers on** (hardware boot)\nRPi is **not** powered yet

SysTask -> SysTask: MCU firmware boots, system task starts

== System Task Callback_Init ==

SysTask -> SysTask: Storage, tshell, power supply init
SysTask -> AudioTask: Start Audio task (wait)
SysTask -> RpiTask: Start RpiLink task (wait)
note right: RPi task init: board_link_bluetooth_init()\nset_power(**false**), hold reset\n**RPi still unpowered**

SysTask -> SysTask: Check boot conditions\n(power_on_after_update || button held)
SysTask -> SysTask: postMessage(SetPowerState On) to self

== Power-On: PreOn — Hardware Bring-up ==

SysTask -> SysTask: setTransition(PreOn)
SysTask -> AudioTask: postMessage(SetPowerState PreOn)
note right: Enable boost converter (PVDD),\nIO expander, amp PDN pins,\nbattery LED indication
SysTask <-- AudioTask: notify (PreOn complete)

SysTask -> RpiTask: postMessage(SetPowerState PreOn)
note right: **No Linux-ready wait here**\nonly MCU-side RPi rail/UART bring-up

RpiTask -> RpiTask: board_link_bluetooth_reset(true)\nboard_link_bluetooth_set_power(false)
RpiTask -> RpiTask: short delay
RpiTask -> RpiTask: board_link_bluetooth_reset(false)\nboard_link_bluetooth_set_power(true)
note right: **RPi hardware powers on NOW**\nLinux boot starts (~10-30s)
RpiTask -> RpiTask: bsp_bluetooth_uart_clear_buffer()
RpiTask -> RpiTask: actionslink_init()
RpiTask -> SysTask: notify(PreOn complete)

SysTask -> SysTask: p_power_state.set(PreOn)

== Power-On: Async Handshake to On ==

note over RpiTask: actionslink_tick() runs in task idle\nwhile System state is PreOn/On

== RPi Boot Completes ==

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Raspberry Pi OS boot completes

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: configure-moode.service runs
note right: Mynd RPi Link helper (runs before Moode)\n\n- Ensures SSH, UART, I2C enabled\n- Ensures dtoverlay=hifiberry-dac\n- Configures moode DB: I2S DAC, mixer\n- Sets volknob to boot volume\n- Reboots ONLY if boot config changed

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: mynd-rpi-link.service starts
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Daemon starts, ActionsLinkClient connects
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Register event/request handlers
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Short connection stabilization delay

RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_system_ready event**
note left: Daemon startup sends once.\nTransport-layer retries/timeouts apply inside send_event.

SysTask -> SysTask: setTransition(On)

== Power-On: On Transition ==

SysTask -> AudioTask: postMessage(SetPowerState On)
note right: Check board_link_amps_fs_ready():\nIf I2S clock detected -> setup_amps()\nIf not -> defer to idle polling\n(pending_amp_setup = true)
SysTask <-- AudioTask: notify (On complete)

SysTask -> RpiTask: postMessage(SetPowerState On)
RpiTask -> RpiDaemon: **setPowerState(ON) request**
alt No initial MCU power-state request arrives within startup fallback window (~5s)
    RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: ensure_startup_power_on()
    RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: get_mcu_firmware_version request
    RpiTask -> RpiDaemon: get_mcu_firmware_version response
    RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: synthetic ON flow + daemon init
    RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_power_state(ON) event** (synthetic ON)
end
note right: Daemon restarted or updated after MCU has already\ntransitioned to ON, so no new setPowerState(ON) will arrive.\nStartup fallback issues get_mcu_firmware_version request;\non successful response daemon performs synthetic ON:\nnotify_power_state(ON) + daemon service init.\nOn failure, the streaming monitor will not start.
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: Response: Success
SysTask -> SysTask: p_power_state.set(On)

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Start streaming monitor
note right: Polls MPD periodically\nNotifies: host_source, stream_state\nBoot volume set by configure-moode.service
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_power_state(ON) event**
RpiTask -> RpiTask: setProperty(RpiLink::PowerState::On)
note over SysTask, Moode: **System Fully Operational**

== Power-Off Sequence ==

SysTask -> SysTask: Power button or auto-shutdown

=== PreOff: Task Audio ==

SysTask -> SysTask: setTransition(PreOff)
SysTask -> AudioTask: postMessage(SetPowerState PreOff)
note right: LED animations, etc.
SysTask <-- AudioTask: notify (PreOff complete)

=== PreOff: RPi (head start on shutdown) ==

SysTask -> RpiTask: postMessage(SetPowerState PreOff)

RpiTask -> RpiDaemon: **setPowerState(OFF) request**
note left: Sent during PreOff\nGives RPi head start on shutdown

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Short delay (prevent ACK race)
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **Response: Success**

RpiTask -> SysTask: notify(PreOff complete)

=== Off: Task Audio ==

SysTask -> SysTask: setTransition(Off)
SysTask -> AudioTask: postMessage(SetPowerState Off)
note right: Turn off amps
SysTask <-- AudioTask: notify (Off complete)

=== Off: RPi ==

SysTask -> RpiTask: postMessage(SetPowerState Off)

RpiTask -> RpiTask: wait_for_rpi_off()
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Short delay (allow MCU tick processing)
RpiDaemon -> Moode: Pause playback (if playing, fire-and-forget)
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Stop streaming monitor
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Prepare shutdown (sync filesystem)
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Initiate poweroff (sudo poweroff returns immediately)

RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: notify_host_source(UNKNOWN)
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_power_state(OFF) event**
note left: RPi proceeds with shutdown\neven if MCU doesn't ACK

RpiTask -> RpiTask: setProperty(RpiLink::PowerState::Off)
RpiTask -> RpiTask: actionslink_deinit()
RpiTask -> RpiTask: board_link_bluetooth_reset(true)\nboard_link_bluetooth_set_power(false)
RpiTask -> SysTask: notify(Off complete)

note over RpiDaemon: System shutdown continues\n(initiated before notify was sent)

SysTask -> SysTask: board_link_power_supply_hold_on(false)
SysTask -> SysTask: p_power_state.set(Off)

== Drag-and-Drop Firmware Update Sequence ==

note over SysTask, Moode: **User wants to update MCU firmware**

AudioTask -> AudioTask: Power+Minus button combo (LongPress detected)
AudioTask -> RpiTask: postMessage(DragAndDropUpdate)
note right: Non-blocking post from Audio task\nPrepare RPi shutdown\nbefore MCU enters bootloader

RpiTask -> RpiTask: isProperty(RpiLink::PowerState::On)
alt RPi already Off
    note over RpiTask: Skip shutdown, already off
end
RpiTask -> RpiDaemon: **setPowerState(SHUTDOWN_REQUEST) request**

RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Short delay (prevent ACK race)
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **Response: Success**
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Short delay (allow MCU tick processing)

RpiTask -> RpiTask: wait_for_rpi_off()
note left: MCU waits in loop:\nwhile (!isPropertyOneOf(Off, ShutdownRequested))\n  actionslink_tick()

RpiDaemon -> Moode: Pause playback (if playing, fire-and-forget)
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Stop streaming monitor
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Prepare shutdown (sync filesystem)
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Initiate poweroff (sudo poweroff returns immediately)

RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: notify_host_source(UNKNOWN)
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_power_state(SHUTDOWN_REQUEST) event**

RpiTask -> RpiTask: setProperty(RpiLink::PowerState::ShutdownRequested)

note over RpiDaemon: System shutdown continues


RpiTask -> RpiTask: SyncPrimitive::notify(ot_id)

note over AudioTask: User continues holding Power+Minus

AudioTask -> AudioTask: VeryVeryLongPress detected
AudioTask -> AudioTask: Write magic value to RTC backup register
AudioTask -> AudioTask: NVIC_SystemReset()
note over SysTask: **MCU drag-and-drop update mode**\nUSB mass storage device appears\nUser can drag firmware file

== RpiLink Daemon Disabled/Deactivated/Uninstalled via SSH (RPi remains On) ==

RpiDaemon -> Moode: Pause playback (if playing, fire-and-forget)
RpiDaemon -> RpiDaemon: Stop streaming monitor
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: notify_host_source(UNKNOWN)
RpiDaemon -> RpiTask: **notify_power_state(Standby) event**
RpiTask -> RpiTask: setProperty(RpiLink::PowerState::Standby)

== Request Deduplication & Retransmission ==

note over RpiTask, RpiDaemon
  **Retry Mechanism:**
  - MCU: ActionsLink automatically retries failed transmissions
  - RPi: Request handlers track last seq_id per request type
  - Duplicate seq_id → request ignored (prevents double-processing)
  
  **Short delays in daemon prevent race conditions:**
  - Before responses: prevents ACK race with incoming request
  - Before notify_power_state: allows MCU actionslink_tick() processing
  - After connect: connection stabilization
  - Startup fallback: if no MCU power state soon after connect,\n    daemon sends get_mcu_firmware_version then synthetic ON flow
  
  **Critical Ordering (Power-Off):**
  1. Prepare shutdown (pause, sync)
  2. Initiate poweroff (sudo poweroff - returns immediately)
  3. Send notify_host_source(UNKNOWN)
  4. Send notify_power_state(OFF) - proceeds even if no ACK
  5. System shutdown continues (already initiated in step 2)
end note

@enduml
